  m_text: Welcome Player! The goal of this game is quite simple. The train needs
    to leave the station but it doesnt have enough fuel. Though it looks like a standard
    coal train, the mechanics inside it let it run on Solar Energy, Hydro Energy
    and Wind Energy. You will have to collect items that store these various energy
    sources going forward. Once youve collected all three and put them in the cradle,
    the train will be on its way. Good Luck!
